<title>USA: Xpedite enters Singapore venture.</title>
<headline>Xpedite enters Singapore venture.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xpedite Systems Inc said on Monday it has agreed to enter a joint venture for the sale of the company's services in Singapore with Transniko Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>The venture will operate in Singapore as Xpedite Global Communications Pte Ltd, Xpedite said.</p>
<p>Xpedite Systems, a provider of fax and electronic messaging services, will own 50 percent of the venture and has an option to acquire the remaining 50 percent, the company said. Transniko is a privately held telecommunications service provider based in Singapore.</p>
</text>
